[ti:कागद काली कलम]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Cinematic & Other]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]🎵 KA KAA RAHASYA
[00:14.46]Narrator-Style Mystical Ballad
[00:17.69]🎵 k.. ka... kaa... kaaa... kyaa...
[00:20.92]🎵 k.. ka...
[00:24.15]🎵 Fir kahe ko kahe ko kahe kau
[00:27.38]🎵 Fir kaalaa kaagad kaalee kalam
[00:30.61]🎵 Fir kaal likhe kaal mitaave
[00:33.85]🎵 Fir kaa kaa arth na jaane koi
[00:37.08]🎤 कः इति ब्रह्म। प्रश्नः एव सृष्टिः। (Yāska)
[00:40.31]🎵 kaa... kaaa...
[00:43.54]🎵 Fir kaahe kaahe kaahe re kaa
[00:46.77]🎵 Fir ka kha ga gha – sab teraa khel
[00:50.00]🎵 Fir khaali kaagar kaahe bulaave
[00:53.23]🎵 Fir kaam krodh kaa maare mel
[00:56.46]🎵 kyaa...
[00:59.69]🎤 नादात्मकं जगत्सर्वं नाद एव परं पदम् (Gorakhnath)
[01:02.92]🎵 ka kau ke – Fir ka se kau – teeno taar
[01:06.15]🎵 ken kabhyaam – dohraa dvaar
[01:09.38]🎵 kai kahe kai baar – kaa ke beech mein kaun karaar
[01:12.61]🎵 kavim kaviim kavayah – Fir kavi bhi kya jaane kaa kaa arth
[01:15.84]🎵 Fir kavi bhi phire kaal ke harth
[01:19.08]🎤 कः – कौ – के | केन – काभ्याम् – कैः (Pāṇini)
[01:22.31]🎵 kahaam katham kathaam
[01:25.54]🎵 Fir kahaam gayaa kaun kaho
[01:28.77]🎵 Fir katham kathaam kahe kaho
[01:32.00]🎵 Fir kathaam ki kathaa kya kya
[01:35.23]🎵 Fir kaal ke kaan mein kaun kaa kya
[01:38.46]🎤 ಎಲ್ಲ ಕವಿಗಳು ಹೋದರು – ಗುಹೇಶ್ವರನ ಲಿಂಗವ ಬಲ್ಲವರಾರು (Allama Prabhu)
[01:41.69]🎵 kasmin kyo keshu
[01:44.92]🎵 Fir kasmin jag mein kyo phire
[01:48.15]🎵 Fir keshu hi kaa kaanta chire
[01:51.38]🎵 Fir kyo kahe kaal kaa khel kare
[01:54.61]🎵 Fir kaa kaa bandhan kaahe dhare
[01:57.84]🎤 ੴ ਸਤਿ ਨਾਮੁ ਕਰਤਾ ਪੁਰਖੁ (Guru Nanak)
[02:01.07]🎵 ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[02:04.31]🎵 kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[02:07.54]🎵 nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[02:10.77]🎵 e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[02:14.00]🎵 kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[02:17.23]🎵 kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[02:20.46]🎵 Fir kadaa na chhute – kaal kaa haath
[02:23.69]🎵 Fir kachcha kaahe – kachcha saath
[02:26.92]🎵 Fir karpaan uthaave – kaal kaa naath
[02:30.15]🎵 Fir kanghi kare – kesh bhi raakhe
[02:33.38]🎵 Fir kaal ke aage sab kuchh bhaakhe
[02:36.61]🎤 ਕੜਾ, ਕਛੈਰਾ, ਕ੍ਰਿਪਾਨ, ਕੰਘੀ, ਕੇਸ – ਇਹ ਪੰਜ ਕਕਾਰੇ ਸਾਚੇ ਭੇਸ (Guru Gobind Singh tradition)
[02:39.84]🎵 sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[02:43.07]🎵 Fir sakkha kaun – jo kaal na jaane
[02:46.30]🎵 bhesh badale – kaal pahichaane
[02:49.54]🎵 kaal jo pahichaan liya – rahasya aap hi aaya
[02:52.77]🎵 chanddalaa de dna nai – onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[02:56.00]🎵 Fir dohkaa kaun – jo kaal de daale
[02:59.23]🎵 kaal se bachna – ka kaa samhaale
[03:02.46]🎤 कंकर काहे करै तक़रीर – काबा कौन, कौन बुतखाना (Kabir)
[03:05.69]🎵 khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[03:08.92]🎵 kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[03:12.15]🎵 kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[03:15.38]🎵 kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[03:18.61]🎵 kaafir kahe kaaba chale – qazi kahe qabar chale
[03:21.84]🎵 kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[03:25.07]🎵 kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[03:28.30]🎵 kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[03:31.53]🎵 kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[03:34.77]🎵 kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[03:38.00]🎵 kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[03:41.23]🎵 khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[03:44.46]🎵 kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[03:47.69]🎵 kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[03:50.92]🎵 kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[03:54.15]🎵 kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[03:57.38]🎵 kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[04:00.61]🎵 kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[04:03.84]🎵 keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[04:07.07]🎵 ka kau ke – teeno paal
[04:10.30]🎵 ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[04:13.53]🎵 kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[04:16.76]🎵 kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[04:20.00]🎵 ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[04:23.23]🎵 kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[04:26.46]🎵 jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[04:29.69]🎵 so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
[04:32.92]🎵 ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[04:36.15]🎵 kya kaun kab kaise kahan – nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[04:39.38]🎵 e mera naanak we matwaalaa – kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[04:42.61]🎵 kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[04:45.84]🎵 sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[04:49.07]🎵 chanddalaa de dna nai – onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[04:52.30]🕉️ Call & Response:
[04:55.53]जेह? → so ka
[04:58.76]कवन? → so khaas
[05:01.99]कहाँ? → so khanjar
[05:05.23]किस करण? → so kiran
[05:08.46]🕉️ All: so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
[05:11.69]🎵 ka kau ke – ken kabhyaam kai
[05:14.92]🎵 kavim kaviim kavayah
[05:18.15]🎵 kahaam katham kathaam – kasmin kyo keshu
[05:21.38]🎵 kaa... kaaa... kyaa?
